{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203320","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203320","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1320332001:1":{"text":"我听到了！你，你们！又在直呼子爵先生的姓名！","source_cn":"我听到了！你，你们！又在直呼子爵先生的姓名！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14EC8E0F04F4950D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320332002:1":{"text":"你们应该称呼他为子爵先生！或者子爵阁下！","source_cn":"你们应该称呼他为子爵先生！或者子爵阁下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87467CD634983A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320332003:1":{"text":"……他自己都不在意，你为什么非要纠正我们啊？","source_cn":"……他自己都不在意，你为什么非要纠正我们啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22E8DD392C4F6131","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320332004:1":{"text":"哼！小小仓鼠，哪里懂得贵族的荣耀！","source_cn":"哼！小小仓鼠，哪里懂得贵族的荣耀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68F5B09EFA071395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320332005:1":{"text":"先生的子爵之位，可是独一无二的荣誉！","source_cn":"先生的子爵之位，可是独一无二的荣誉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x128A79E1A9EB1B99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320332006:1":{"text":"虽然以柳博米尔生前的年龄来说，他能获得子爵之位确实很厉害，但也没有这么夸张吧？","source_cn":"虽然以柳博米尔生前的年龄来说，他能获得子爵之位确实很厉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3F19E50CC3A29EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320332007:1":{"text":"一点也不夸张！你们知道先生为什么会获得子爵之位吗？","source_cn":"一点也不夸张！你们知道先生为什么会获得子爵之位吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DC9576D2068F272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320332008:1":{"text":"——是因为先生在艺术方面的成就！！","source_cn":"——是因为先生在艺术方面的成就！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF0B68BCF504996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320332009:1":{"text":"没有战绩，没有功勋，仅仅是因为先生高超的艺术造诣！你们知道这是多么大的荣耀吗！","source_cn":"没有战绩，没有功勋，仅仅是因为先生高超的艺术造诣！你们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AFA157427F01C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320332010:1":{"text":"即使是在整个耀光帝国，也只有先生获得过这般荣誉！所以每个人都应该发自内心地尊敬他！","source_cn":"即使是在整个耀光帝国，也只有先生获得过这般荣誉！所以每...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D95FD342C3928F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320332011:1":{"text":"等等，你们别走——我还没说完！","source_cn":"等等，你们别走——我还没说完！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0CAECA60B02DB76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:烛台守卫":{"text":"烛台守卫","source":"烛台守卫","status":"source"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":3}}